# Local LLM for medical-kg-qa: qwen3.5:9b with
# - a context window for the longest planner/answer prompts (~8.3k tokens measured)
#   plus the 1,400-token completion cap; Ollama's default 4,096 silently truncates
#   longer prompts. 12,288 keeps ~86% of layers on an 8 GB GPU (16,384 kept 84%);
# - no presence penalty. The upstream default (1.5) penalises every token already
#   used, which works against JSON plans and entity lists. The client already sends
#   temperature 0, matching the cloud runs' greedy, penalty-free decoding.
#   ollama pull qwen3.5:9b
#   ollama create medkg-qwen3.5-9b -f ollama/qwen3.5-9b.Modelfile
FROM qwen3.5:9b
PARAMETER num_ctx 12288
PARAMETER presence_penalty 0
